@FinTrack.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5215

### Cadastrar usuário (201; 409 se o e-mail já existir)
POST {{FinTrack.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/registrar
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "davi@exemplo.com",
  "senha": "senha-forte-123"
}

### Login: o token da resposta é usado nas próximas requisições
# @name login
POST {{FinTrack.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "davi@exemplo.com",
  "senha": "senha-forte-123"
}

###
@token = {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Listar categorias
GET {{FinTrack.Api_HostAddress}}/api/categorias
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Listar contas
GET {{FinTrack.Api_HostAddress}}/api/contas
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Criar transação (201)
POST {{FinTrack.Api_HostAddress}}/api/transacoes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "descricao": "Almoço",
  "valor": 42.90,
  "data": "2026-10-20T12:30:00Z",
  "tipo": "Despesa",
  "categoriaId": 3,
  "contaId": 1
}

### Criar transação inválida (400)
POST {{FinTrack.Api_HostAddress}}/api/transacoes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "descricao": "",
  "valor": -10,
  "data": "2099-01-01T00:00:00Z",
  "tipo": "Despesa",
  "categoriaId": 0,
  "contaId": 0
}

### Tipo incompatível com a categoria (422)
POST {{FinTrack.Api_HostAddress}}/api/transacoes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "descricao": "Despesa lançada em Salário",
  "valor": 10,
  "data": "2026-10-20T12:30:00Z",
  "tipo": "Despesa",
  "categoriaId": 1,
  "contaId": 1
}

### Listar transações com filtros
GET {{FinTrack.Api_HostAddress}}/api/transacoes?tipo=Despesa&page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Obter transação por id
GET {{FinTrack.Api_HostAddress}}/api/transacoes/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Transação inexistente (404)
GET {{FinTrack.Api_HostAddress}}/api/transacoes/999999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Relatório mensal
GET {{FinTrack.Api_HostAddress}}/api/relatorios/mensal?ano=2026&mes=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Relatório anual
GET {{FinTrack.Api_HostAddress}}/api/relatorios/anual?ano=2026
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Sem token (401)
GET {{FinTrack.Api_HostAddress}}/api/transacoes
Accept: application/json
